  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A pilot project to transform the social and environmental conditions in riverine zones for equitable and sustainable urban development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is expected to contribute to the achievement of SGD 11 &#x2013; sustainable cities and communities by improving the environmental and social conditions for urban communities living in riverine zones in Hanoi. With knowledge/experiences gained and lessons learned from project implementation, it will contribute to advocating Hanoi authority to ensure social and ecological sustainability in urban development.</narrative>
  </description>
